# Per-cycle snapshot-driven pipeline scratch files (bot/README.md "Snapshot-driven mode").
# Contain live account data (cash, positions, cost basis, tax lots) and/or an unapproved
# trade plan awaiting user confirmation — never committed; only the specific files listed
# in a plan/finalize result's `files_changed` are committed each cycle.
/snapshot.json
/plan_result.json
/finalize_result.json
